harness: jxl-encoder/examples/lz77_hash_ab.rs with JXL_LZ77_STATS=1 JXL_LZ77_NO_EARLYOUT=1
  (the early-out must be DISABLED or it returns before the summary line and biases the sample)
command: cargo run --release --example lz77_hash_ab -- \
    ~/work/zen/imazen-26-png-v3/png-v3 ~/tmp/acc_grid.tsv --images 40 --size 512
corpus: CORRECTED 2026-09-27: imazen-26 png-v3 general photographs 1000..1039,
  not all 21 strata. The retained acc_grid.tsv identifies all 40 sources;
  all 1200 committed greedy rows match acc_grid.log in order. Historical
  selection sorted paths and took the first usable images, without stratification.
  See issue103_110_audit_2026-09-27.md and lz77_acceptance_sources_2026-09-27.tsv.
cells: 1200 greedy streams (u8/u16/f32 x lossless e8/e9 x lossy e9 per image)
host: Mac aarch64
what a row is: one apply_lz77_backref call; `ratio` is bit_decrease/threshold,
  where the acceptance test is `bit_decrease > total_symbols*0.2 + 16`
